          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>BenQ AH30ST 3000-Lumen Short-Throw 1080P LED Golf Simulator Projector</h2><p>The <strong>BenQ AH30ST</strong> is a dedicated <strong>1080P short-throw LED golf simulator projector</strong> built for smaller sim rooms and low ceilings. With <strong>3,000 ANSI lumens</strong>, <strong>Full HD (1920×1080)</strong> resolution, and a golf-tuned 4LED light engine, it delivers bright, accurate course visuals while keeping heat, noise, and maintenance low. :contentReference</p><p>A <strong>0.69–0.83:1 short-throw ratio</strong>, <strong>low 102.5% offset</strong>, and BenQ’s <strong>Screen Fill</strong> (Auto Screen Fill) make it easy to mount the projector safely behind and above the hitting area—even in tight garage bays—while still filling your impact screen. Pair that with a <strong>4LED light source rated up to 20,000–30,000 hours</strong> and BenQ’s <strong>Golf Mode</strong> color tuning, and the AH30ST becomes a killer value for 1080p golf sims that don’t need 4K or laser pricing.</p>",
            "class": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
