    "sn_product_includes_6qaEcj": {
      "type": "sn-product-includes",
      "blocks": {
        "card_RTdkg8": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/1.png",
            "title": "1080P 4LED Engine for Smaller Bays",
            "text": "<p>The AH30ST gives you true 1080P with a long-life 4LED light source that’s ideal for daily sim sessions.</p><ul><li> <strong>Resolution:</strong> Full HD 1080P (1920×1080) for sharp sim UI and shot data</li><li> <strong>Brightness:</strong> 3,000 ANSI lumens – great for single-stall bays and controlled light rooms </li><li> <strong>Contrast:</strong> 20,000:1 (FOFO) for solid separation between fairways, greens, and shadows </li><li> <strong>Light Source:</strong> 4LED, rated up to <strong>20,000–30,000 hours</strong> (Normal/Eco) </li><li> <strong>Golf Mode:</strong> BenQ’s golf-tuned color profile for realistic turf, sand, and sky </li></ul>",
            "class": ""
          }
        },
        "card_zpWcdV": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/2.png",
            "title": "Short-Throw, Low-Offset Golf Design",
            "text": "<p>The AH30ST is built specifically for low ceilings and tight golf sim installs.</p><ul><li> <strong>Throw Ratio:</strong> 0.69–0.83:1 for big images from a short distance </li><li> <strong>Projection Offset:</strong> ~102.5% to keep the image low on the wall without extreme tilt </li><li> <strong>Zoom:</strong> 1.2× optical zoom for fine-tuning screen width without moving the mount </li><li>Optimized to sit <strong>behind and above the golfer</strong>, reducing shadows and shank risk </li></ul>",
            "class": ""
          }
        },
        "card_EUqg8c": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/3.png",
            "title": "Screen Fill for Faster Setup",
            "text": "<p>BenQ’s setup tools help you get a clean, screen-filling image without endless trial and error.</p><ul><li> <strong>Screen Fill (Auto Screen Fill):</strong> automatically fills 16:9, 16:10, 4:3, or 1:1 screens</li><li>Designed to reduce wasted pixels and keep image geometry tight on golf impact screens</li><li> <strong>3D Keystone:</strong> vertical, horizontal, and rotation adjustment for squaring the image in tricky rooms </li><li>Perfect for first-time sim builders who want a <strong>simpler setup experience</strong></li></ul>",
            "class": ""
          }
        },
        "card_gtGWwr": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/4.png",
            "title": "Sim-Ready Performance for Multi-Use Rooms",
            "text": "<p>The AH30ST is tuned for golf but doubles nicely for movies, sports, and casual gaming.</p><ul><li> <strong>Input lag ~16–17 ms</strong> in Game Mode – responsive enough for sim and console play </li><li>Full HD 1080P pairs well with 1080P sim PCs and streaming devices</li><li>Supports <strong>16:9, 16:10, 4:3, and 1:1</strong> aspect ratios for different screen setups </li><li>Great fit if you want <strong>one projector</strong> for golf, Netflix, and game nights</li></ul>",
            "class": ""
          }
        },
        "card_H6r7MA": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5.png",
            "title": "Long-Life 4LED for Sim Reliability",
            "text": "<p>The 4LED engine is built for long-term use with minimal maintenance.</p><ul><li> <strong>Light source life:</strong> up to 20,000 hours (Normal) / 30,000 hours (Eco) </li><li> <strong>Filter-free, dust-resistant design</strong> keeps upkeep simple for garage and basement sims </li><li>No traditional lamp replacements, less brightness drop-off over time vs bulb-based projectors</li><li>Ideal for heavy practice schedules and family use where the projector gets turned on a lot</li></ul>",
            "class": ""
          }
        }
      },
